# content-service - deploy/env/content.env (copy from this file; never commit the real one).
# Only what content-service reads at runtime and compose does NOT set. Compose already sets the wiring
# (ports, DATABASE_URL, REDIS_*, RABBITMQ_URL, *_GRPC_URL, JWT_*, SERVICE_CLIENT_SECRET) from deploy/.env.
# Empty KEY= lines are required values; commented lines are optional tunables with their default.

# Optional.
# Generation models offered (comma list) and the default one; must match what ai-service serves.
# AI2_GENERATION_MODEL_NAMES=
# AI2_DEFAULT_MODEL=
